    },
    {
      "id": "red_block_yaw",
      "name": "red_block yaw",
      "datatype": "number",
      "unit": "deg",
      "description": "Yaw about world Z, in [0, 90). Taken from the minimum-area rectangle of the colour silhouette, with its corners deprojected to world coordinates first - the raw image-space angle is not the world angle, because the camera views the table at a tilt. Reports -1.0 when not measurable (occluded, or no usable silhouette); never a fabricated angle.",
      "nominal_range": {
        "min": -1.0,
        "max": 90.0
      },
      "accuracy": 5.0,
      "sample_rate_hz": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "green_block_yaw",
      "name": "green_block yaw",
      "datatype": "number",
      "unit": "deg",
      "description": "Yaw about world Z, in [0, 90). Taken from the minimum-area rectangle of the colour silhouette, with its corners deprojected to world coordinates first - the raw image-space angle is not the world angle, because the camera views the table at a tilt. Reports -1.0 when not measurable (occluded, or no usable silhouette); never a fabricated angle.",
      "nominal_range": {
        "min": -1.0,
        "max": 90.0
      },
      "accuracy": 5.0,
      "sample_rate_hz": 20.0
    },
    {
      "id": "blue_block_yaw",
      "name": "blue_block yaw",
